WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.979
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B one, Book one.

2
00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:08.514
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.814 --> 00:00:16.041
Unit twenty-five: Review: Getting to Know Me. Today you will look back at your progress in B1 Book 1.

4
00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:18.877
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:23.159
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:24.017 --> 00:00:25.111
Introduce.

7
00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:28.557
Introduce means to tell people who you are.

8
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.335
I can introduce myself in English.

9
00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.405
Your turn. Say: Introduce.

10
00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:38.384
Introduce.

11
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:39.965
Hobby.

12
00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:44.018
Hobby means something you enjoy doing in your free time.

13
00:00:44.617 --> 00:00:46.430
My hobby is photography.

14
00:00:47.017 --> 00:00:49.147
Your turn. Say: Hobby.

15
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.908
Hobby.

16
00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.512
Family.

17
00:00:55.517 --> 00:00:58.178
Family means parents, children and relatives.

18
00:00:58.783 --> 00:01:00.864
I can describe my family tree.

19
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.905
Your turn. Say: Family.

20
00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:07.547
Family.

21
00:01:08.283 --> 00:01:09.087
School.

22
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.675
School means a place where students learn.

23
00:01:13.283 --> 00:01:15.480
I can talk about my school subjects.

24
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.666
Your turn. Say: School.

25
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.397
School.

26
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:23.907
Goal.

27
00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.090
Goal means something you want to achieve.

28
00:01:27.683 --> 00:01:29.567
My goal is to speak fluently.

29
00:01:30.183 --> 00:01:32.290
Your turn. Say: Goal.

30
00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:35.775
Goal.

31
00:01:36.517 --> 00:01:37.228
Proud.

32
00:01:38.217 --> 00:01:40.123
Proud means happy about what you did.

33
00:01:40.717 --> 00:01:42.438
I'm proud of my progress.

34
00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.354
Your turn. Say: Proud.

35
00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:48.969
Proud.

36
00:01:49.717 --> 00:01:50.799
Improve.

37
00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:53.574
Improve means to get better.

38
00:01:54.183 --> 00:01:55.916
I want to improve my writing.

39
00:01:56.517 --> 00:01:58.774
Your turn. Say: Improve.

40
00:02:01.633 --> 00:02:02.704
Improve.

41
00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.196
Future.

42
00:02:05.183 --> 00:02:07.102
Future means the time that will come.

43
00:02:07.717 --> 00:02:09.832
English will help me in the future.

44
00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:12.941
Your turn. Say: Future.

45
00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.720
Future.

46
00:02:17.533 --> 00:02:21.242
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:25.514
Visal, you finished B1 Book 1! How do you feel?

48
00:02:26.617 --> 00:02:30.755
I feel proud! I can introduce myself confidently now.

49
00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.234
What else can you do?

50
00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:39.031
I can talk about my family, my school and my hobbies.

51
00:02:40.117 --> 00:02:41.663
What's your next goal?

52
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.537
I want to improve my writing and speak more fluently.

53
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.700
Part three: grammar.

54
00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:53.153
Grammar focus: I can and I want to.

55
00:02:53.453 --> 00:02:54.652
Look at the pattern.

56
00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.083
I can introduce myself.

57
00:02:57.983 --> 00:03:00.215
I can give my opinion about films.

58
00:03:01.117 --> 00:03:02.989
I want to speak more fluently.

59
00:03:03.933 --> 00:03:08.104
Use 'I can' for what you are able to do now and 'I want to' for your next goals.

60
00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:12.292
Be careful! Don't say: I can to introduce myself.

61
00:03:14.233 --> 00:03:16.779
Say: I can introduce myself.

62
00:03:17.079 --> 00:03:18.741
Don't use 'to' after 'can'.

63
00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:22.313
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.158
My B1 Journey So Far.

65
00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:29.895
In this book, I learned to introduce myself and describe my personality.

66
00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.815
I can talk about my family, school, hobbies and daily routine.

67
00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.437
I can give advice, tell a story in the past and share my opinions.

68
00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:42.526
I'm proud of my progress this year.

69
00:03:43.533 --> 00:03:47.948
My goal is to improve my English for the future, so I'm ready for Book 2!

70
00:03:49.033 --> 00:03:52.733
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

71
00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:55.072
I can blank myself.

72
00:03:55.372 --> 00:03:59.652
A, introduce. B, to introduce. C, introducing.

73
00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.676
The answer is A: introduce.

74
00:04:06.817 --> 00:04:08.816
Happy about what you did is blank.

75
00:04:09.116 --> 00:04:12.166
A, proud. B, shy. C, bored.

76
00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.537
The answer is A: proud.

77
00:04:18.683 --> 00:04:20.126
To get better is to blank.

78
00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:24.125
A, improve. B, introduce. C, prefer.

79
00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.666
The answer is A: improve.

80
00:04:30.867 --> 00:04:34.088
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

81
00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:36.926
What are you most proud of in this level?

82
00:04:45.717 --> 00:04:47.159
Now listen to Visal.

83
00:04:47.459 --> 00:04:53.548
I'm most proud that I can introduce myself and give my opinions. I want to improve my writing next.

84
00:04:53.848 --> 00:04:55.499
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:04:56.383 --> 00:05:01.079
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and i can and i want to.

86
00:05:01.379 --> 00:05:05.332
Today's value is confidence. Speak up and be proud of who you are.

87
00:05:05.632 --> 00:05:11.677
Congratulations! You have finished Online B one, Book one. See you in Online B one, Book two!

88
00:05:11.977 --> 00:05:14.838
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

